{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Vanessa Breaks Up With Marco"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "The Nightmare Date"}, {"type": "position", "content": 1}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 12}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe characteristics of different people and their jobs."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le12ob01re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Simple Past Tense"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Simple Past tense to talk about:<p> <ul> <li>actions or events that happened at a specific time in the past</li> <li>finished events in the past</li></ul> You use the Simple Past to tell a story and report about actions, events and people."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'm so happy I caught you!"}, {"type": "example", "content": "We got in his car and drove to a restaurant."}, {"type": "example", "content": "He took me to a movie."}, {"type": "text", "content": "There are regular and irregular verbs.</p> You need to changes the spelling of irregular verbs to make them Past tense.</p> Here are some examples: "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":9,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Irregular Verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past Tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"catch\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"caught\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ring\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"rang\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"take\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"took\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"think\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"thought\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"leave\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"left\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"have\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"had\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"get\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"got\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"drive\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"drove\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Past Continuous Tense"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Past Continuous Tense to talk about an action that was happening in the past. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You often use the Past Continuous tense and the Simple Past tense together in a sentence."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use both of these tenses to talk about an action that interrupted another action."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:</p> When you <span class=\"strong\">rang</span> (SIMPLE PAST) I <span class=\"strong\">was getting</span> ready to leave (PAST CONTINUOUS)."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "fake"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "not real; not true"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He is so fake!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le12ob01aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to describe people."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "repulsive"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "disgusting; very unpleasant"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The movie was repulsive."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le12ob01aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "aloof"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "unfriendly; uncaring; distant"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He became aloof after the movie."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le12ob01aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "quiet"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "not talking; distant"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He became quiet and aloof."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le12ob01aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "weird"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "strange; odd"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The date was really weird."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le12ob01aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "trendy"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "very fashionable"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We went to a trendy restaurant."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le12ob01aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "nightmare"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a very bad dream"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I had a nightmare about our date."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le12ob01aud07"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Write a short paragraph (8 -10 lines) about a nightmare experience you had. Write about a date, a trip or a moment at work or school."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use adjectives."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use the Simple Past and Past Continuous tenses."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your paragraph to your partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I use the Simple Past and Past Continuous tenses."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write 8 -10 lines about my nightmare experience."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use adjectives to describe things and feelings."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le12ob01re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le12ob01re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le12ob01re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sally! I'm so happy I caught you! </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hey, V! Yeah. When you rang I was just getting ready to leave. What's up?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I had a big fight with Marco! He's so fake!", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le12ob01re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Really? I thought you guys were getting along so well!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Not any more! He took me to a movie, which I thought was going to be super fun. It was  totally repulsive, not a date movie! After we left the theater, he was so quiet and aloof. I thought I did something wrong.", "id": 2, "time": "12000", "image": "engenn5le12ob01re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: How strange!</br> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yeah, it was really weird.</br> <span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: What did you do?</br> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I just pretended everything was fine. We got in his car and drove to this really trendy restaurant. </br> <span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: That sounds ok \u2026</br> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yeah, except for the fact that his ex-girlfriend works there!  It was a nightmare!", "id": 3, "time": "31000", "image": "engenn5le12ob01re2img02.jpg"}]}}]}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"questi